      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-02T13:11:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, that\u0027s a good news. I assumed the protection ranges are constant / hardcoded in rom-code / your private flash lib.",
      "parentUuid": "44588673_3f21e8c2",
      "revId": "c768fb84b0673458119d52d90e855e2d801ac088",
