      "writtenOn": "2026-02-19T08:37:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it possible to check if the protection settings are correct. I mean not to check if bank is protected or not. I mean if some internal configuration is correct. You cans see an example in a different [cros_flash driver](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/cros_flash/cros_flash_andestech_xip.c;l\u003d285-290). It checks the configuration register, not  the protection status itself.",
      "revId": "c768fb84b0673458119d52d90e855e2d801ac088",
