      "message": "Thanks for the reference and the clarification.\nI’ll review the details more carefully and follow up with the appropriate updates.\nAppreciate your guidance!",
      "parentUuid": "264c1b63_888aadf5",
      "revId": "c768fb84b0673458119d52d90e855e2d801ac088",
