      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-18T03:50:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have confirmed with our team that there is no \"error register\" in the EM32F967.\nOnly two registers are available, both sharing the same format as described above.\nWe write to register A, and the hardware processes the operation and updates register B (read-only) accordingly.\nThe protection status is then determined by our library API through reading register B.",
      "parentUuid": "c5c6ba8f_ab575747",
      "revId": "c768fb84b0673458119d52d90e855e2d801ac088",
